# "You draw two cards and lose 2 life" are separate instructions: Bot2's Leovold stops Bot1 drawing more than one card
# each turn, Bot1 has drawn its turn-3 card, so the Whisper draws none (hand 5, not 7) and the 2 life are lost all the same.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Night's Whisper
Island x4
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Leovold, Emissary of Trest
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Leovold, Emissary of Trest.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Night's Whisper.Cast

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
